  "question": "Where can I find a park within 100 kilometers, oriented toward the south of Shavers Creek Environmental Center, Petersburg, PA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.909905 40.667715)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.909905 40.667715)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND leisure = 'park'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 157.5 AND 202.5;\n",
